# NOTE ON SCOPE (this bit us): GNU Stow reads <package>/.stow-local-ignore,
# then ~/.stow-global-ignore — it does NOT read a .stow-local-ignore at the
# stow-directory root. This file therefore matches nothing at stow time; the
# repo-root entries below only ever "worked" because those files live outside
# every package and stow never looks at them.
#
# The real guardrails are:
#   - check_packages() in install.sh (root-level files + machine-state names)
#   - the package-hygiene job in .github/workflows/ci.yml
# If a specific package ever needs to hide a file from stow, put a
# .stow-local-ignore inside THAT package directory.
#
# Kept as documentation of the repo-root files that are not packages:
README\.md
AGENTS\.md
install\.sh
install-deps\.sh
install-tex\.sh
bootstrap\.sh
Brewfile
Brewfile\.lock\.json
Brewfile\.docker
\.bak$
\.DS_Store
terminfo
karabiner
